      "note": "The same namespace-only parent, reached through the read SLOT rather than the stat chokepoint. cat/wc/head/tail/md5sum/cut above stat the operand first and so already saw it; these commands read straight from the backend, which on a keyed mount answers ENOENT because there is no key. Each one also carries GNU's own exit code for a failed read, which is the command's and not the errno's."
    },
